  "description": "基础班上有时候会有同学觉得第一课关于函数的内容很难理解。经过针对性的研究，我发现他们很多是受到了曾经学过的数学的干扰。",
  "body_html": "<p>基础班上有时候会有同学觉得第一课关于函数的内容很难理解。经过针对性的研究，我发现他们很多是受到了曾经学过的数学的干扰。</p><p>最开头学数学的时候，数学老师总是讲函数就是 y = x^2 + 3x 这样的东西。到后来不知什么时候，数学老师又说函数是 f(x) = x^2 + 3x 这样的东西…… 到现在我这里又重新来一遍，就糊涂了。</p><p>于是我又想起之前看过的一个逻辑学家的论文，他的名字叫 Gottlob Frege。他写过一篇论文叫《What is a Function？》。在这篇文章里，Frege 指出了数学里使用函数的方式的错误，写成 y = x^2 + 3x 那种写法的问题。这篇文章发表于1904年，可是数学教学到今天都还没改过来。</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!M9MJ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F89956d5c-87b2-4197-ac34-c01043030f44_775x300.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!M9MJ!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F89956d5c-87b2-4197-ac34-c01043030f44_775x300.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!M9MJ!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F89956d5c-87b2-4197-ac34-c01043030f44_775x300.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!M9MJ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F89956d5c-87b2-4197-ac34-c01043030f44_775x300.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!M9MJ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F89956d5c-87b2-4197-ac34-c01043030f44_775x300.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!M9MJ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F89956d5c-87b2-4197-ac34-c01043030f44_775x300.jpeg\" width=\"472\" height=\"182.70967741935485\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/89956d5c-87b2-4197-ac34-c01043030f44_775x300.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:300,&quot;width&quot;:775,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:472,&quot;bytes&quot;:220475,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!M9MJ!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F89956d5c-87b2-4197-ac34-c01043030f44_775x300.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!M9MJ!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F89956d5c-87b2-4197-ac34-c01043030f44_775x300.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!M9MJ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F89956d5c-87b2-4197-ac34-c01043030f44_775x300.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!M9MJ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F89956d5c-87b2-4197-ac34-c01043030f44_775x300.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>因为这个问题，数学变得不必要的困难。特别是遇到微积分的时候，这种函数表达就更加…</p>",
